    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>You must have access to your Meta Business Manager and WhatsApp Business Account (WABA).</p>\n</div>\n<p>Set up and update your WhatsApp display name so customers see your business name instead of your phone number.</p>\n<p>Following Meta’s guidelines helps you get approved faster and avoid rejections.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Meta reviews and approves display names.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"62dd19954994\">Edit your display name in Klaviyo</h2>\n<p>To change your display name in Klaviyo:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your account name in the lower left. </li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Settings &gt; WhatsApp</strong>. </li>\n<li>Find the <em>WhatsApp phone numbers </em>section.</li>\n<li>Click the 3-dot menu next to a phone number. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>View</strong>. <br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/6ct6b26e/help-center-prod/22fc2411707732cfcdffb60de30adaca9c4f5b9e-1284x232.png\" alt=\"Phone number with the 3-dot menu opened\" width=\"full\">\n</li>\n<li>In the right-panel, find the <em>Display name </em>field.</li>\n<li>Edit the display name, then click <strong>Save</strong>. </li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Any edit to a display name must be reviewed by Meta, which takes a few business days. The change does not show to customers until Meta approves.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion accordion--default\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item-title\"><strong>Change display name in Meta</strong></div>\n<div class=\"accordion__item-content\">\n<p>Follow these steps to update your display name.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open Meta Business Manager and select your business.</li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>WhatsApp Manager</strong>.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Account tools</strong> &gt; <strong>Phone numbers &gt; Profile</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter your new display name.</li>\n<li>Submit your name for review.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Meta typically reviews display names within a few days.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7VB5YQFRTHMPSN1B5J\">Display name guidelines</h2>\n<p>Follow Meta’s rules to improve approval success. For full details, please see <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/business/help/757569725593362\">Meta's support documentation</a>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V9856M5ZYHSTCSZ4J\">What your display name must include</h3>\n<p>Your display name must:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Represent your business, product, service, or department</li>\n<li>Match your external branding</li>\n<li>Clearly relate to your legal business name</li>\n<li>Contain at least 3 characters</li>\n<li>Follow <a href=\"https://business.whatsapp.com/policy\">WhatsApp Commerce and Business policies</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V5ZEWN8EFBKXR1WZG\">What your display name cannot include</h3>\n<p>Your display name must not:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use all caps unless it matches your branding</li>\n<li>Include emojis or special symbols</li>\n<li>Contain unnecessary extra words</li>\n<li>Be formatted as a URL</li>\n<li>Include “Official” or “Verified”</li>\n<li>Reference Meta product names</li>\n<li>Be a generic term or location alone</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7VF7DA66PZ1R2136R2\">Display name examples</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Submitted name</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n<th>Reason</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fresh Produce Cold Pressed Juices</td>\n<td>Accepted</td>\n<td>Matches website branding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP Cold Pressed Juices</td>\n<td>Rejected</td>\n<td>Abbreviation not consistent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fresh Produce Mexico</td>\n<td>Accepted</td>\n<td>Country qualifier allowed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fresh Produce Official Account</td>\n<td>Rejected</td>\n<td>Implies endorsement</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FreshProduce.com</td>\n<td>Rejected</td>\n<td>URL format not allowed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KT</td>\n<td>Rejected</td>\n<td>Too short</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V78Y3BWPVTKZE3EH5\">What happens after you submit</h2>\n<p>After submission, Meta reviews your display name and assigns a status:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Approved</li>\n<li>Rejected</li>\n<li>Under review<br>\n<p>Your display name becomes visible when:</p>\n</li>\n<li>Your Meta Business Portfolio is verified, or</li>\n<li>You reach at least <strong>2,000 daily business-initiated conversations</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V2HPZWCKXCMR9BW27\">Troubleshooting</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7VJB7FS6AWB7XQ2D6B\">My display name was rejected</h3>\n<p>Common reasons:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Does not match website branding</li>\n<li>Language mismatch</li>\n<li>Formatting issues</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To fix this:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Match your display name to your website.</li>\n<li>Update your site if needed.</li>\n<li>Resubmit in Meta.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V4AZQSHPKYCXZ7Y30\">My display name is approved, but customers still see my phone number</h3>\n<p>Your account has not met visibility requirements.</p>\n<p>You need:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A verified Meta Business Portfolio, or</li>\n<li>At least <strong>2,000 daily business-initiated conversations</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V53QGMPRGBNFXH0S3\">I want the blue checkmark (Official Business Account)</h3>\n<p>Your display name must be approved first.</p>\n<p>Fix any issues, then apply in WhatsApp Manager.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQXWD7V9DHDFSE0NJP2XZET\">Next steps</h2>\n<p>After updating your display name:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Review how display names work.</li>\n<li>Verify your Meta Business Portfolio.</li>\n<li>Increase messaging activity to meet visibility requirements.</li>\n</ol>",
